# The memory bank is working notes, not source. This entry is deliberately
# repo-local: the ignore is currently coming from the global
# `core.excludesFile`, so on a machine without that file the memory bank would
# become tracked. See docs/design/09-open-items.md item 13.
/.memory-bank/

# Manual stdio probe transcripts. The inputs in scripts/ are tracked; what the
# probe writes is not.
/scripts/out/